@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ==============================================================================
### 1. AUTENTICACIÓN (LOGIN Y CAPTURA DE TOKENS)
### ==============================================================================

### [1.1] Login como ADMIN (Emite y captura @tokenAdmin)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@libreria.test",
  "password": "Admin1234"
}

### Variable para reutilizar el token de ADMIN
@tokenAdmin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### [1.2] Login como CLIENTE (Emite y captura @tokenCliente)
# @name loginCliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cliente@libreria.test",
  "password": "Cliente1234"
}

### Variable para reutilizar el token de CLIENTE
@tokenCliente = {{loginCliente.response.body.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### 2. CONSULTAS PÚBLICAS (Lectura sin token -> 200 OK)
### ==============================================================================

### 1. Listar todos los libros (incluye autores) -> 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros

### 2. Filtrar libros disponibles -> 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros?disponible=true

### 3. Obtener libro por ID válido -> 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/1


### ==============================================================================
### 3. OPERACIONES DE ESCRITURA CON ADMIN (Éxito -> 201 / 200 / 204)
### ==============================================================================

### 4. Crear libro exitoso (conectado a George R. Martin autorId: 1) -> 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/libros
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Choque de Reyes",
  "precio": 27000,
  "imagen": "https://images.cdn1.buscalibre.com/fit-in/360x360/portada-choque-de-reyes.jpg",
  "disponible": true,
  "autorId": 1
}

### 5. Actualizar libro existente -> 200 OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "precio": 26500
}


### ==============================================================================
### 4. CASOS DE ERROR CONTROLADO (Clase 17 con token ADMIN)
### ==============================================================================

### 6. Error 400 Bad Request: ID no numérico en URL (validateParams)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/abc

### 7. Error 400 Bad Request: Body inválido con precio negativo (Zod)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/libros
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Libro Erróneo",
  "precio": -500,
  "imagen": "https://link.jpg",
  "autorId": 1
}

### 8. Error 404 Not Found: Modificar libro inexistente (P2025)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "No existo"
}

### 9. Error 409 Conflict: Clave foránea inexistente (autorId inexistente - P2003)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/libros
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Libro Fantasma",
  "precio": 15000,
  "imagen": "https://link.jpg",
  "autorId": 9999
}

### 10. Eliminar un libro -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/3
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}


### ==============================================================================
### 5. PRUEBAS DE SEGURIDAD, REGISTRO Y ROLES (Clase 18)
### ==============================================================================

### 11. Registro exitoso -> 201 Created (sin passwordHash)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana Perez",
  "email": "ana.perez@libreria.test",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### 12. Registro email duplicado -> 409 Conflict (P2002)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana Duplicada",
  "email": "ana.perez@libreria.test",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### 13. Registro con contraseña débil (< 8 caracteres) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Error Pass",
  "email": "error@libreria.test",
  "password": "corta"
}

### 14. Login con usuario inexistente -> 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "fantasma@libreria.test",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### 15. Login con password errónea -> 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@libreria.test",
  "password": "PasswordEquivocada"
}

### 16. GET /yo sin header Authorization -> 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/yo

### 17. GET /yo con token de CLIENTE -> 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/yo
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCliente}}

### 18. POST /libros sin token -> 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/libros
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Libro Sin Token",
  "precio": 12000,
  "imagen": "https://link.jpg",
  "autorId": 1
}

### 19. POST /libros con token CLIENTE -> 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/libros
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCliente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Libro de Cliente",
  "precio": 12000,
  "imagen": "https://link.jpg",
  "autorId": 1
}